				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -4.5d
			y: -20.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["15B51FB56A64C303"]
			description: [
				"&5图书馆允许成年公民培养智力，这一重要属性能加速他们未来职业的技能习得速度。&r"
				""
				"&5Be aware that scholarship is a singular pursuit: a student cannot labor elsewhere while studying. However, supplying them with paper and books will expedite their education, ensuring they return to the workforce as productive prolateriats rather than disgraceful dullards.&r"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
